# URL of your server-side matching endpoint (Supabase Edge Function, Vercel
# function, etc.). It must hold the model API key SERVER-SIDE — never ship a
# model key in the browser. When unset, the app falls back to a local heuristic
# so you can develop the UI without a backend.
#
# Expected contract:
#   POST  { profile: Profile, solicitations: Solicitation[] }
#   200   MatchScore[]
